  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人文研究方法論(二)",
    "sub_ename": "METHODOLOGY ON HUMANITIES RESEARCH (2)",
    "describe_ch": "以學術倫理為基礎，回顧人文學術及應用領域之沿革，引介相關研究資源與文獻，透過專題演講及座談，讓研究生瞭解不同領域之研究方法及發展趨勢，熟悉摘要、書評、學術論文、技術報告等展現研究成果的體例與呈現方式。",
    "describe_eh": "By using academic ethics as the foundation, reviewing the revolution of humanities academic and applied fields, and introducing relevant research resources and literary works; enable graduates to understand different research methodology and development trend, understanding the way of presenting the final outcomes of summary, book reviews, academic thesis and technical reports through keynote speeches and colloquium.",
